  "page_title": "Mar27",
  "content": "<div class=\"u_1486369071 dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1486369071\" style=\"transition: none; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-29 text-align-center size-36\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.11em;\"><span class=\"m-font-size-29 font-size-36\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: unset; text-decoration: underline;\">2026-27 SEASON</span></p></div><div class=\"u_1887927626 dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1887927626\" style=\"transition: none; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"text-align-center m-size-24 size-30\"><strong class=\"font-size-30 m-font-size-24\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Northern Lights - <br/>Nielsen &amp; Sibelius</strong></p><p class=\"m-size-19 text-align-center size-24\"><span class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">March 12 - 13, 2027</span></p><p class=\"m-size-19 text-align-center size-24\"><span class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The VETS, Providence</span></p></div><div class=\"u_DetailsIconAnchor dmNewParagraph\" data-anchor=\"Details Icon Anchor\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"DetailsIconAnchor\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"> <h2><strong style=\"display: initial; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Concert Details</strong></h2>\n</div><div class=\"u_1719886704 dmNewParagraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1719886704\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-16 size-20\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">Open Rehearsal:</strong><span style=\"display: initial;\"><span style=\"display: initial;\">\u00a0</span>\n</span><strong class=\"m-font-size-16 font-size-20\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: initial;\"><br/>Friday, March 12, 5:30PM</strong></p> <ul class=\"defaultList bullet\"><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"line-height: 2; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Runtime is approximately 150 minutes with a 20 minute break at the conductor's discretion. Rehearsal order is at the conductor's discretion.<br/></span><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"m-size-16 size-20\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">TACO Classical Concert:</strong><span single-space=\"true\" style=\"display: initial;\"> <span style=\"display: initial;\"></span>\n</span><strong class=\"m-font-size-16 font-size-20\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: initial;\"><br/>Saturday, March 13, 7:30PM</strong></p> <ul class=\"defaultList bullet\"><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Runtime is approximately 90 minutes including a 20 minute intermission.</span></li><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">There will be a post-concert Q&amp;A after the concert with Benjamin Manis and Brannon Cho.</span></li><li><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1899346547\" style=\"transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;\"><p class=\"m-size-36 size-45\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-36 font-size-45\" style=\"font-weight: bold; display: unset; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">About the Music</strong></p></div><div class=\"u_1678221425 dmNewParagraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1678221425\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">NIELSEN:</strong>\n<strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Helios</strong><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">: Overture</strong></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">TCHAIKOVSKY:</strong>\n<strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Variations on a Rococo Theme</strong></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">SIBELIUS: Symphony No.5</strong></p><p><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">Performing Artists</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.riphil.org/orchestra-personnel\" runtime_url=\"https://www.riphil.org/orchestra-personnel\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(235, 238, 255); text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\">The Rhode Island Philharmonic Orchestra</a></p><p><a href=\"https://benjaminmanis.com/about\" runtime_url=\"https://benjaminmanis.com/about\" style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\"><strong>Benjamin Manis, conductor</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://brannoncho.com/about\" runtime_url=\"https://brannoncho.com/about\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; display: initial; text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\"><strong>Brannon Cho, cello</strong></a></p><p><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></p></div><div background-image\":\"\"}\"=\"\" class=\"u_1090736037 dmNewParagraph\" data-ai-tag=\"Paragraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-styletopreserve=\"{\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1090736037\" style=\"\"><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">The VETS in Providence is the home of the Rhode Island Philharmonic Orchestra. Since 1950, The VETS has held a unique place in the cultural life of Rhode Island as a performance venue for legendary artists, local performers and community traditions.</span></p><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">On the National Register of Historic Places, The VETS is located on the revitalized Avenue of the Arts across from the R</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: unset;\">I State House. With just over 2,000 seats, it is acclaimed for its unique combination of size and intimacy. The theater celebrates flawless acoustics, a breathtaking proscenium stage and exquisite interior with a one-of-a-kind ceiling featuring the shields of RI's original 39 communities.</span></p></div>",
  "headsection": "\r\n  <link type=\"application/rss+xml\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://www.riphil.org/feed/rss2\"/>\r\n  <link type=\"application/atom+xml\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://www.riphil.org/feed/atom\"/>\r\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\r\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.riphil.org/mar27\"/>\r\n\r\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/>\r\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com//ac52c946/dms3rep/multi/opt/RIPHIL+Logo-1920w.png\"/>\r\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com//ac52c946/dms3rep/multi/opt/RIPHIL+Logo-1920w.png\"/>\r\n",
